<title>SOUTH KOREA: Kumho Group targets sales of 6 trln won in 1997.</title>
<headline>Kumho Group targets sales of 6 trln won in 1997.</headline>
<dateline>SEOUL 1996-12-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>South Korea's Kumho Group on Tuesday said it had targeted sales of six trillion won in 1997, compared with an estimated sales of 4.9 trillion won in 1996.  </p>
<p>Korea Kumho Petrochemical Co Ltd set its 1997 sales its target at 870 billion won, compared with an estimated 630 billion won this year.</p>
<p>Kumho Construction and Engineering Co Ltd targeted sales of 1.42 trillion won for 1997 against an estimated 1.20 trillion won in 1996.</p>
<p>-- Seoul Newsroom (822) 727 5651</p>
</text>
